{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43195","headline":"同崔员外温泉宫即事 · 郭汭","name":"同崔员外温泉宫即事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"辇辂移双阙，宸游整六师。\n天回紫微座，日转羽林旗。\n雷气寒戈戟，军容壮武貔。\n弓鸣射雁处，泉暖跃龙时。\n惠化成观俗，讴谣入赋诗。\n同欢王道盛，相与咏雍熙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郭汭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43195.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43195","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}